ature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#696969;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Please <strong>click<\/strong> on the 5 thumbnail images below to view more info on each topic.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com\/portfolio-1-weddings'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01weddings-and-great-moments-pixan.jpg\" alt=\"01weddings-and-great-moments-pixan.jpg\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com\/portfolio-7-trash-the-dress'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/amazing-trash-the-dress-pixan-photography.jpg\" alt=\"amazing-trash-the-dress-pixan-photograph\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pixanphoto.com'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01pixan-photography-logo-bdwf.jpg\" alt=\"01pixan-photography-logo-bdwf.jpg\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/mad.ly\/cabe64'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01download-our-wedding-welcome-guide-pixan.jpg\" alt=\"01download-our-wedding-welcome-guide-pix\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/mad.ly\/3112b4'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/01pixan-riviera-maya-honeymoon-photo-adventure.jpg\" alt=\"01pixan-riviera-maya-honeymoon-photo-adv\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pixanphoto'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pixanphotograph\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/pixanphoto.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/04\/Pinterest.png\" alt=\"Pinterest.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/vimeo.com\/pixanphotography'><img src=\"h