Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":6,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":496,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1877900,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":280946,"Name":"SusanMarie813","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1423245536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1415299513,"LastPoster":{"Id":281318,"Name":"patdawson","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1879696,"PostDate":1417699807,"PostContent":"Cool, will \u00a0  Great to hear, will check them out.","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"patriciadawson23@gmail.com","IpAddress":"41.206.11.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417698663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"patdawson","Id":281318,"Name":"patdawson","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78353,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bbaceb45565010d179a66bc0b99df82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ok I am so overwhelmed and it has only been a few days. &amp;nbsp;This site is awesome..&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My FI and I are going to do site visits of some resorts we would like to see in person. &amp;nbsp;Originally in February but changing it to next month we have the time to take from work.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you had a wedding planner I would love to hear your experience. &amp;nbsp;Will they setup the site visits, meet us while in Mexico? &amp;nbsp;Maybe offer suggestions of resorts based on criteria we are looking at??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can you recommend your planning company?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lastly if you did not have one do you wish you did?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Looking at Dreams Tulum, HRH MR, Finest Playa Mujers (new resort), Azul Beach or Azul Fives.. But just read the beach is not that private at Beach so maybe Sensotori.. last one Paradisus la Esmalda...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Now you see why we are overwhelmed. &amp;nbsp;LOL&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877900,"PostDate":1415299513,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ok I am so overwhelmed and it has only been a few days. \u00a0This site is awesome..\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My FI and I are going to do site visits of some resorts we would like to see in person. \u00a0Originally in February but changing it to next month we have the time to take from work.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you had a wedding planner I would love to hear your experience. \u00a0Will they setup the site visits, meet us while in Mexico? \u00a0Maybe offer suggestions of resorts based on criteria we are looking at??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can you recommend your planning company?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lastly if you did not have one do you wish you did?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Looking at Dreams Tulum, HRH MR, Finest Playa Mujers (new resort), Azul Beach or Azul Fives.. But just read the beach is not that private at Beach so maybe Sensotori.. last one Paradisus la Esmalda...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Now you see why we are overwhelmed. \u00a0LOL<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"susanlaurelli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414829404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1423245536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SusanMarie813","Id":280946,"Name":"SusanMarie813","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.208.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78353,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2e4ad8293b28d510720b4a51a050832","RawContent":"I don&#039;t think you need a separate wedding planner. If you work with a TA that specializes in destination weddings and work with them to narrow down your options and pin point what&#039;s truly important to create the wedding of your dreams I think you will find the stress subside. Choosing your resort is the hardest part, but once you are there- the planning can easily be done between your resort coordinator and using this board! \n\n\nIt gets easier... Promise!","Attachments":[],"Id":1877902,"PostDate":1415303465,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I don't think you need a separate wedding planner. If you work with a TA that specializes in destination weddings and work with them to narrow down your options and pin point what's truly important to create the wedding of your dreams I think you will find the stress subside. Choosing your resort is the hardest part, but once you are there- the planning can easily be done between your resort coordinator and using this board! <br><br>\nIt gets easier... Promise! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390227808,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78353,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36a904d07b961f4db5cd50e1a26f7e28","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Also, in addition to choosing a helpful TA, once you decide on the resort you will be mainly planning your wedding with the wedding coordinator.&amp;nbsp; Keep in mind that planning Destination WEdding is different than a hometown wedding.&amp;nbsp; You will not get responses from your wedding coordinator as quickly as&amp;nbsp; you would prob prefer...this doesn&#039;t mean that they won&#039;t be getting things done..it just means that they have other weddings that they are dealing with that are happening right now. We have been slowly planning our wedding but I haven&#039;t found that a wedding planner is needed.&amp;nbsp; You will prob be able gage that once you start communicating with your WC and actually once you decide on your resort too.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877914,"PostDate":1415337280,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Also, in addition to choosing a helpful TA, once you decide on the resort you will be mainly planning your wedding with the wedding coordinator.\u00a0 Keep in mind that planning Destination WEdding is different than a hometown wedding.\u00a0 You will not get responses from your wedding coordinator as quickly as\u00a0 you would prob prefer...this doesn't mean that they won't be getting things done..it just means that they have other weddings that they are dealing with that are happening right now. We have been slowly planning our wedding but I haven't found that a wedding planner is needed.\u00a0 You will prob be able gage that once you start communicating with your WC and actually once you decide on your resort too.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396954052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1413833555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalero","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalero","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.73.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78353,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfcc07ba2080f8e36c343b6ac8b3e73e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, SusanMarie813, and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! you&#039;re already off to a great start by accessing all the great resources you&#039;ll find here, so well done :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To add more fire to your creativity, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at some of the venues you&#039;re considering - enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152641474894487.1073741910.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Dreams Tulum Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt; ~~~ with excerpt photos here.......&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10521175_10152641475379487_9146626662019589210_o.jpg\" alt=\"10521175_10152641475379487_9146626662019\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172755239_o.jpg\" alt=\"10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150194040364487.322058.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Barcelo Azul Beach Wedding Album.&lt;\/a&gt;....samples here:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xaf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/254701_10150194042469487_6905729_n.jpg?oh=7ab8cbd0299b638ee1a8dcfa9c02922a&amp;amp;oe=54E194D2&amp;amp;__gda__=1424761091_6675d64f4bd764390ac8029f2c68fa2b\" alt=\"254701_10150194042469487_6905729_n.jpg?o\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/249270_10150194043229487_2972420_n.jpg?oh=9978b50dec2387c3a21d624b9afc84bd&amp;amp;oe=54F25729&amp;amp;__gda__=1423136912_6fa7a9e432365bb5bb829cede50e29d6\" alt=\"249270_10150194043229487_2972420_n.jpg?o\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152072326374487.1073741871.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Azul Sensatori Wedding Album.&lt;\/a&gt;.....samples here:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/1523559_10152072328309487_1063127546_o.jpg\" alt=\"1523559_10152072328309487_1063127546_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/861050_10152072330254487_590033321_o.jpg\" alt=\"861050_10152072330254487_590033321_o.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877928,"PostDate":1415340914,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, SusanMarie813, and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! you're already off to a great start by accessing all the great resources you'll find here, so well done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To add more fire to your creativity, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at some of the venues you're considering - enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152641474894487.1073741910.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Dreams Tulum Wedding Album<\/a> ~~~ with excerpt photos here.......<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10521175_10152641475379487_9146626662019589210_o.jpg\" alt=\"10521175_10152641475379487_9146626662019\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172755239_o.jpg\" alt=\"10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150194040364487.322058.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Azul Beach Wedding Album.<\/a>....samples here:<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xaf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/254701_10150194042469487_6905729_n.jpg?oh=7ab8cbd0299b638ee1a8dcfa9c02922a&oe=54E194D2&__gda__=1424761091_6675d64f4bd764390ac8029f2c68fa2b\" alt=\"254701_10150194042469487_6905729_n.jpg?o\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/249270_10150194043229487_2972420_n.jpg?oh=9978b50dec2387c3a21d624b9afc84bd&oe=54F25729&__gda__=1423136912_6fa7a9e432365bb5bb829cede50e29d6\" alt=\"249270_10150194043229487_2972420_n.jpg?o\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152072326374487.1073741871.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Azul Sensatori Wedding Album.<\/a>.....samples here:<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/1523559_10152072328309487_1063127546_o.jpg\" alt=\"1523559_10152072328309487_1063127546_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-mia.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/861050_10152072330254487_590033321_o.jpg\" alt=\"861050_10152072330254487_590033321_o.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78353,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"183701e493d09c85ee2ea9de24faa530","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Update: &amp;nbsp;So I paid for Destination Weddings.com and so far I have a terrific person that I am dealing with. &amp;nbsp;Answers my emails right away. &amp;nbsp;Is setting up all my site visits. &amp;nbsp;Set up my transportation etc. &amp;nbsp;So far so good and I feel like a big weight lifted off of me.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878469,"PostDate":1416055557,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Update: \u00a0So I paid for Destination Weddings.com and so far I have a terrific person that I am dealing with. \u00a0Answers my emails right away. \u00a0Is setting up all my site visits. \u00a0Set up my transportation etc. \u00a0So far so good and I feel like a big weight lifted off of me.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"susanlaurelli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"47.17.228.244","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414829404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280946.jpg?_r=1423245536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SusanMarie813","Id":280946,"Name":"SusanMarie813","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"41.206.11.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78353,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5915c44c1da49940a5315495e613204e","RawContent":"Cool, will\n[quote name=\"SusanMarie813\" post=\"1878469\" timestamp=\"1416084357\"]\nUpdate:  So I paid for Destination Weddings.com and so far I have a terrific person that I am dealing with.  Answers my emails right away.  Is setting up all my site visits.  Set up my transportation etc.  So far so good and I feel like a big weight lifted off of me.[\/quote]Great to hear, will check them out.","Attachments":[],"Id":1879696,"PostDate":1417699807,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Cool, will<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SusanMarie813, on 15 November 2014 - 12:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Update: \u00a0So I paid for Destination Weddings.com and so far I have a terrific person that I am dealing with. \u00a0Answers my emails right away. \u00a0Is setting up all my site visits. \u00a0Set up my transportation etc. \u00a0So far so good and I feel like a big weight lifted off of me.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Great to hear, will check them out.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"patriciadawson23@gmail.com","IpAddress":"41.206.11.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417698663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"patdawson","Id":281318,"Name":"patdawson","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78353","Title":"Wedding Planner Yes Or No?","LastPostDate":1417699807},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}